  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「ほんと、もたもたしてるうちに時間ばっかり経っちゃったよね。焦っちゃうよ、あたしもいつか卒業する。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「いつまでも、ゆきちゃんのそばで世話を焼いてあげられないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「もはや懐かしいけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「ゆきちゃんが寂しくて校舎裏に落書きしたメールアドレスにさ、転校生が連絡してさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「そっから、ふたりの付きあいが始まったんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「運命的だよ、少女漫画みたいな。神さまがくれた縁だよ、大事にしてほしいよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「ゆきちゃんが自分から誰かに関わろうとするのって、すっごい珍しいんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「応援したいんだよ、あたしは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「転校生との関係を築くのに失敗したら、ゆきちゃんは今よりもっと他人と関わることに臆病になっちゃう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「自分のなかに引きこもって、うじうじするだけの女の子になっちゃう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「そんなの、あたしは見たくないもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「転校生との関係がどうなるにせよ、ゆきちゃんにとって一生の宝物になる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「そんな気がすんの。だから、『ねえさん』としては全力で後押ししてあげたいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「余計なお節介、って言われると反論できないんだけどさ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だいじょうぶ。ゆきちゃんは、ちょっと不器用だけど、かわいくて良い子だもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「転校生くんもそれを知ってるはずだもん、きっと悪いようにはならないよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「つうか、三波ちゃんはそれでいいわけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「他の女の子がさ、転校生と仲良くなっちゃっていいの？　三波ちゃん的には、ど～なの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どういうこと……って言うのはずるいかな、う～ん。よくわからないのが本音なの、わたし的には」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
